From: Dmitrii <bankersenator@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 3 Aug 2025 22:05:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/32] Launcher3: QuickSpace: Animate message updates

Add a slide-and-fade animation for QuickSpace PSA messages and "Now Playing" info to improve the UI

Squashed:

    From: Dmitrii <bankersenator@gmail.com>
    Date: Sun, 3 Aug 2025 22:11:52 +0000
    Subject: Launcher3: Improve QuickSpace performance and memory usage

    Optimized QuickSpace by lazy-loading the ActionReceiver and only re-inflating the main layout when the UI style setting is changed.

    These changes lead to a faster, more responsive launcher experience, especially on lower-end devices.

    (Also includes minor corrections to resolve build errors from recent refactoring.)

    Signed-off-by: Dmitrii <bankersenator@gmail.com>
    Signed-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>

Signed-off-by: Dmitrii <bankersenator@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>
---
 .../launcher3/quickspace/QuickSpaceView.java  | 87 ++++++++++++++-----
 .../quickspace/QuickspaceController.java      |  3 -
 2 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

